      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.24,
      "end_seconds": 7.99,
      "duration_seconds": 6.75,
      "text": "Ah, doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.92,
      "end_seconds": 14.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Yes, come in and and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.17,
      "end_seconds": 28.25,
      "duration_seconds": 13.08,
      "text": "I've, I've been dealing with shivering that has stopped. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.02,
      "end_seconds": 30.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.36,
      "end_seconds": 40.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "uh, I've had it for two weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.25,
      "end_seconds": 44.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.99,
      "end_seconds": 56.11,
      "duration_seconds": 10.12,
      "text": "Confusion goes along with it, uh, most of the time. Okay, so the Confusion? That's been since last Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.93,
      "end_seconds": 67.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Did you get alcohol, fall or head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.8,
      "end_seconds": 71.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.54,
      "end_seconds": 74.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.9,
      "end_seconds": 76.82,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "Breathing's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.57,
      "end_seconds": 99.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.14,
      "end_seconds": 104.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "No, nothing I can think of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.38,
      "end_seconds": 110.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.55,
      "end_seconds": 114.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "no, not that I know of"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.54,
      "end_seconds": 119.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.18,
      "end_seconds": 125.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.72,
      "end_seconds": 128.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.7,
      "end_seconds": 133.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.0,
      "end_seconds": 137.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.46,
      "end_seconds": 139.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "No, none."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.43,
      "end_seconds": 159.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "let me get the readings out of the way"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.37,
      "end_seconds": 172.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.23,
      "end_seconds": 192.31,
      "duration_seconds": 7.08,
      "text": "okay: respiratory rate 15, heart rate 76, BP is 111 over 68. And temp 36.8 degrees"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.56,
      "end_seconds": 195.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.95,
      "end_seconds": 198.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.72,
      "end_seconds": 205.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.05,
      "end_seconds": 210.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.72,
      "end_seconds": 235.43,
      "duration_seconds": 7.71,
      "text": "Your temperature is twenty-nine degrees, your skin is ice cold and your pulse is very slow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.69,
      "end_seconds": 240.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.8,
      "end_seconds": 253.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "okay, so my impression is this: This is probably severe hypothermia"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.82,
      "end_seconds": 259.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Um, um, do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.43,
      "end_seconds": 273.72,
      "duration_seconds": 13.29,
      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned, but right now severe hypothermia is my leading thought, not anything worse i think a blood sugar makes sense here, for hypothermia"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 274.26,
      "end_seconds": 280.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.92,
      "text": "we have a slot Wednesday at 11:30 am, if that that works"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.91,
      "end_seconds": 283.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Okay, I'll be there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.84,
      "end_seconds": 290.7,
      "duration_seconds": 6.86,
      "text": "Handle gently and warm slowly with warm blankets and warm fluids through the drip."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.1,
      "end_seconds": 298.29,
      "duration_seconds": 7.19,
      "text": "Mm, okay. I'll want another look straight away. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.3,
      "end_seconds": 301.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
